<title>MOROCCO: Spain financing Moroccan Mediterranean coast road.</title>
<headline>Spain financing Moroccan Mediterranean coast road.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain on Monday signed a $3.4 million protocol to finance technical studies for a coastal road running from Tangier on Morocco's north Atlantic coast to Saaidia on the Mediterranean.</p>
<p>Morocco's official news agency MAP said the study would cover a road of 560 km (350 miles) of which 300 km (185 miles) were already built but which needed upgrading.</p>
<p>The agreement was signed by Spanish ambassador to Morocco Gabriel Ferran de Alefaro and Moroccan Public Works Minister Abdelaziz Meziane, the agency said.</p>
</text>
